WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.500
Let’s walk through NI & Escalation PLI.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.800
Read the six National Interest domains together with the escalation

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.537
stage and trajectory.

00:00:08.537 --> 00:00:12.613
Confirm the Macro dependency cleared before treating downstream output as

00:00:12.613 --> 00:00:14.275
finalized evidence.

00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:17.975
On this slide, review finalized National Interest domains and

00:00:17.975 --> 00:00:19.788
escalation trajectory.

00:00:19.788 --> 00:00:23.850
In practice, downstream review remains locked until Macro

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:27.863
is finalized or explicitly skipped under the workflow contract.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.523
When you are ready, use Open NI & Escalation

00:00:31.523 --> 00:00:34.347
PLI to move to the live surface.

00:00:34.347 --> 00:00:37.060
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:37.210
.
